  --- the reading ---
  REFUSED, AND ON THE ARM THAT CAN CARRY IT. With the bar FIXED the reward
  fired on 55.0% of windows all run, and syllable-band modulation depth
  still does not beat yoked praise (+0.4 SE; the ratcheting arm -0.1 SE).
  So it is not that the reward stopped arriving -- it arrived continuously
  and did not build a frame. Warlaumont's reward is NOT refuted: what is
  refused is that it installs a frame in THIS larynx, which has no jaw and,
  per `no-sequence`, no module that holds a kick for 10 ms. Their
  oscillation comes from a 1000-neuron recurrent reservoir; this vocal
  module is 126 neurons in 9 groups.
